OL,3,GNEWSA'Car crash' hospital scheme
OL,4,Acriticised by scrutiny
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project to upgrade and extend
OL,7,FGuernsey's Princess Elizabeth Hospital
OL,8,Fhas been labelled a "car crash" by the
OL,9,Fhead of the island's scrutiny
OL,10,Fcommittee.
OL,12,FDeputy Andy Sloan said: "It shouldn't
OL,13,Fbe beyond the wit of man to build some
OL,14,Fof this stuff in a simple,
OL,15,Fcost-effective manner without making a
OL,16,Fcomplete drama out of the whole
OL,17,Fcrisis."
OL,19,FThis week the Committee for Health and
OL,20,FSocial Care (HSC) announced it was
OL,21,Fscrapping the second phase of its
OL,22,Fhospital modernisation programme.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
